WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.760
I'm very sorry to say this, that Brazil is doing poorly

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:06.400
and will continue to do poorly.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:11.400
They can only do well when they're working with us.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.280
Without us, they will fail just as others have failed.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:14.940
It's true.

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:17.040
Next year, the United States will celebrate

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:21.080
the 250th anniversary of our glorious independence,

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:25.320
a testament to enduring power and American freedom and spirit.

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:30.940
We will also be proudly hosting the 2026 FIFA World Cup

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.880
and, shortly thereafter, the 2028 Olympics,

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:35.119
which is going to be very exciting.

00:00:35.119 --> 00:00:36.599
I hope you all come.

00:00:36.599 --> 00:00:39.040
I hope that countless people from all over the globe

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:41.480
will take part of these great —

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:45.080
these will be great celebrations of liberty and human achievement

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:47.720
and that, together, we all can rejoice

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:50.560
in the miracles of history that began in July 4 —

